  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preventive Conservation of Ancient Paracas Textiles and Other Pre-Hispanic Andean Objects in Ica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the preventive conservation of ancient Paracas textiles, archaeological objects, ceramics, and other Pre-Hispanic Andean objects from 800 to 100 BC. Paracas textiles are among the finest in the world and renowned for their technique and iconography. This project includes the cataloging, photo documentation, and registration of objects and the conservation of a small number of textiles deemed at greatest risk of deterioration.</narrative>
  </description>
